                                                "sense_id": "bc5739c3-a76f-3ead-af1f-e9ad44e6a5e6",
                                                "text": "Yes, yes, 'tis he. I will assure you Uncle, the very he, the he your Wisdom plaid withal, I thank you for't, neighed at his Nakedness, and made his Cold and Poverty your Pastime; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
